            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESlimConnect integrates SlimPim (Product Information Management) with Umbraco CMS. Automatically sync your product catalog, categories, variants, images and custom fields from SlimPim to Umbraco content nodes. Includes backoffice dashboard, scheduled sync, and frontend helper services.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/slimpim.slimconnect\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
